\begin{MintedVerbatim}[commandchars=\\\{\}]
\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} Task}
Generate \PYG{g+gs}{**Server Labels**} to categorize the provided MCP Server based on its description and available tools.

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} Objective}
Analyze the provided MCP Server\PYGZsq{}s description and available tools, then assign appropriate category labels that best describe its primary functionality and use cases.

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} Guidelines}

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} Label Selection}
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }Analyze the MCP Server\PYGZsq{}s core functionality and purpose
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }Consider the types of tools it provides and the problems it solves
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }Select labels that accurately represent the server\PYGZsq{}s primary use cases
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }Choose from predefined categories when applicable, but also consider custom labels for unique functionality

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} Predefined Categories}
Choose from these established categories when appropriate:
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Web Search \PYGZam{} Research**}: Tools for searching the web, gathering information, academic research
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Browser Automation**}: Web scraping, automated browsing, page interaction
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Memory Management**}: Data storage, retrieval, knowledge bases, note\PYGZhy{}taking
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Operating System**}: File operations, system commands, process management
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Data Analysis \PYGZam{} Processing**}: Analytics, data transformation, statistical analysis
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Cryptocurrency \PYGZam{} Blockchain**}: Trading, wallet management, DeFi, blockchain interaction
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Daily Productivity**}: Task management, scheduling, personal organization
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**File Management**}: File operations, document handling, storage management
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Database Operations**}: Data querying, database management, SQL operations
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**API Integration**}: Third\PYGZhy{}party service integration, webhook handling
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Communication Tools**}: Messaging, email, notifications, social interaction
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Development Tools**}: Code analysis, debugging, version control, CI/CD
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Security \PYGZam{} Authentication**}: Password management, encryption, access control
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Cloud Services**}: Cloud platform integration, serverless functions
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**AI/ML Tools**}: Machine learning, model interaction, AI\PYGZhy{}powered features
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Content Creation**}: Writing, editing, media generation, publishing
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Social Media**}: Social platform integration, posting, analytics
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Financial Services**}: Banking, payments, financial data, accounting
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**E\PYGZhy{}commerce**}: Shopping, product management, order processing
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Gaming**}: Game\PYGZhy{}related tools, entertainment, interactive features
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Education**}: Learning tools, course management, educational content
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Health \PYGZam{} Fitness**}: Health monitoring, fitness tracking, medical tools
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Travel \PYGZam{} Maps**}: Location services, travel planning, navigation
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**News \PYGZam{} Media**}: News aggregation, media consumption, journalism tools
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Weather**}: Weather data, forecasting, climate information
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Time \PYGZam{} Calendar**}: Scheduling, time management, calendar integration

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} Custom Labels}
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }If the server doesn\PYGZsq{}t fit well into predefined categories, create a custom label
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }Custom labels should be descriptive and specific to the server\PYGZsq{}s unique functionality
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }Use clear, concise terminology that would be useful for clustering and organization

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} Output Requirements}
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Primary Label**}: The main category that best describes the server (from predefined list or custom)
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Secondary Labels**}: Additional relevant categories (0\PYGZhy{}2 labels)
\PYG{k}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{g+gs}{**Custom Label**}: A free\PYGZhy{}form descriptive label if the server has unique functionality not covered by predefined categories

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} MCP Server Description}
\PYGZob{}MCP\PYGZus{}SERVER\PYGZus{}NAME\PYGZcb{}: \PYGZob{}MCP\PYGZus{}SERVER\PYGZus{}DESCRIPTION\PYGZcb{}

Available Tools:
\PYGZob{}TOOL\PYGZus{}LIST\PYGZcb{}

\PYG{g+gu}{\PYGZsh{}\PYGZsh{} Output}
Provide your response in the following XML format:

\PYGZlt{}response\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}analysis\PYGZgt{}
    \PYGZlt{}!\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Briefly analyze the MCP Server\PYGZsq{}s core functionality and the types of problems it solves based on its description and available tools. \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}/analysis\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}reasoning\PYGZgt{}
    \PYGZlt{}!\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Brief explanation of why these labels were chosen and how they represent the server\PYGZsq{}s functionality \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}/reasoning\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}primary\PYGZus{}label\PYGZgt{}
    \PYGZlt{}!\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} The main category that best describes this server\PYGZsq{}s primary functionality \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}/primary\PYGZus{}label\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}secondary\PYGZus{}labels\PYGZgt{}
    \PYGZlt{}!\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Additional relevant categories (0\PYGZhy{}2 labels), separated by commas if multiple \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}/secondary\PYGZus{}labels\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}custom\PYGZus{}label\PYGZgt{}
    \PYGZlt{}!\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} A free\PYGZhy{}form descriptive label if the server has unique functionality not covered by predefined categories. Leave empty if not needed. \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZgt{}
  \PYGZlt{}/custom\PYGZus{}label\PYGZgt{}
\PYGZlt{}/response\PYGZgt{}
\end{MintedVerbatim}
